@startuml state-order
!include style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #5A5A5A
  FontStyle bold
}
title State diagram - Order (OrderStatus)

[*] --> PREPARING : new Order(customer, item, price, turn)\n(Waiter takes the order; price locked)

PREPARING --> PREPARING : prepareOneUnit(turn)\n[unitsDone + 1 < item.prepUnits]\n/ unitsDone++
PREPARING --> READY : prepareOneUnit(turn)\n[last unit]\n/ readyTurn = turn
READY --> SERVED : markServed()\n[canBeServed(turn): readyTurn < turn]
SERVED --> PAID : markPaid()\n(Cashier collects the bill)
PREPARING --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n[customer left]
READY --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n[customer left]

state PAID #C8E6C9
state CANCELLED #FFCDD2
PAID --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

PREPARING : Chef advances one unit per turn
READY : a dish finished this turn is served\nnext turn at the earliest
@enduml
